# Packaged assets are injected into prompts by value and compared by digest, so a checkout that
# rewrote their line endings would change every digest and fail the asset tests. Normalizing the
# whole tree to LF makes those digests a property of the repository rather than of the platform
# the clone happened on.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
